s to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn hints as you progress and use them wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements and uncover intriguing artwork descriptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>rich, atmospheric soundtrack</strong> tailored to each illustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax between puzzles in the <strong>Jukebox</strong>, where you can enjoy unlocked music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy completed illustrations in <strong>full view mode</strong> to appreciate the art in its entirety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: This game is not easy\u2014but that\u2019s exactly what makes solving each puzzle so rewarding. If you crave a true test of focus and love getting lost in art, Deja View is for you.</strong></p>","developers":["Gemcraft Games","Bleeding Moon Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/25a6eb70fc51c8f5f7d3f7aa3a4c9e46841b705b/header.jpg?t=1748865195","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581940/977322911/dacefafbb165ce20ec326dab8f4c5283ad18b790/1750460396/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746718527","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581940/977322911/dacefafbb165ce20ec326dab8f4c5283ad18b790/1750460396/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746718527","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581940/977322911/dacefafbb165ce20ec326dab8f4c5283ad18b790/1750460396/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746718527","id":257136894,"name":"Deja View - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136894/f90b3f7719e2a7016ccc1ab3813935a4582c2ee9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746718527"}],"name":"Deja View - A Spot The Difference Gam